              <item>
               <widget class="QLabel" name="imageTitle_8">
                <property name="font">
                 <font>
                  <family>Segoe UI</family>
                  <pointsize>12</pointsize>
                  <bold>true</bold>
                 </font>
                </property>
                <property name="styleSheet">
                 <string notr="true">color: #3498db;</string>
                </property>
                <property name="text">
                 <string>Использование segmentation-models (PyTorch)</string>
                </property>
               </widget>
              </item>
              <item>
               <widget class="QScrollArea" name="scrollArea_17">
                <property name="widgetResizable">
                 <bool>true</bool>
                </property>
                <widget class="QWidget" name="scrollAreaWidgetContents_17">
                 <property name="geometry">
                  <rect>
                   <x>0</x>
                   <y>0</y>
                   <width>522</width>
                   <height>1737</height>
                  </rect>
                 </property>
                 <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_55">
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="label_10">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Segmentation Models – это библиотека, написанная на PyTorch, предназначенная для облегчения построения и тренировки моделей сегментации изображений. Библиотека предлагает готовые решения для популярных архитектур, таких как U-Net, DeepLabV3+, LinkNet и других, что позволяет пользователям сосредоточиться непосредственно на задачах сегментации, минуя необходимость самостоятельно реализовывать каждую деталь архитектуры.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Ключевые преимущества:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Универсальность&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;: Позволяет легко менять архетипы и бэкбонеты (архитектуры-представители, такие как ResNet, DenseNet, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Удобство&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;: Простота интеграции готовых решений и возможность быстрой адаптации под конкретные задачи.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Модульность&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;: Возможность тонкой настройки любых компонентов сети, включая loss-функции, оптимизации и прочее.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Совместимость&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;: Легко интегрируется с популярными пакетами PyTorch, такими как torchvision и albumentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Установка библиотеки:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;pip install segmentation-models-pytorch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Структура и использование:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:medium; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;1. Подготовка данных:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Перед началом работы с моделью нужно подготовить данные. Обычно это делается через DataLoader, предоставляемый PyTorch:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;from torch.utils.data import Dataset, DataLoader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;class CustomDataset(Dataset):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    def __init__(self, images_path, masks_path, transforms=None):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        self.images = sorted(glob.glob(images_path))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        self.masks = sorted(glob.glob(masks_path))&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        self.transforms = transforms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    def __len__(self):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        return len(self.images)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    def __getitem__(self, idx):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        img = imread(self.images[idx])&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt; mask = imread(self.masks[idx])&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        if self.transforms is not None:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;            transformed = self.transforms(image=img, mask=mask)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;            img = transformed[&amp;quot;image&amp;quot;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;            mask = transformed[&amp;quot;mask&amp;quot;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        return img, mask&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:medium; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;2. Выбор архитектуры и бэкбонета:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Segmentation Models предоставляет удобные абстракции для загрузки и настройки различных архитектур:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;import segmentation_models_pytorch as smp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;# Загружаем модель U-Net с бэкбонетом ResNet34&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;model = smp.Unet(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    encoder_name=&amp;quot;resnet34&amp;quot;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    in_channels=3,               # Кол-во каналов входного изображения&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    classes=NUM_CLASSES,         # Кол-во классов&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    activation='softmax'&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:medium; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;3. Определение loss-функции и оптимизатора:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Выбор подходящей loss-функции важен для успешного обучения модели. В зависимости от задачи можно выбрать различные варианты:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;loss_function = smp.utils.losses.CrossEntropyLoss()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=LEARNING_RATE)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h4 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:medium; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;4. Тренировка модели:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Процесс обучения аналогичен стандартной процедуре обучения нейросети в PyTorch:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;for epoch in range(NUM_EPOCHS):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;    for batch_idx, (images, masks) in enumerate(train_loader):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        optimizer.zero_grad()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        outputs = model(images)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        loss = loss_function(outputs, masks)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        loss.backward()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New'; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;        optimizer.step()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman','serif'; font-size:large; font-weight:700; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Особенности и советы:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Используйте предобученные веса для ускорения обучения (например, ImageNet pretrained weights).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Экспериментируйте с разными бэкбонетами (например, MobileNet, Inception, EfficientNet) для снижения вычислительной сложности.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Symbol'; font-size:10pt; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:7pt; color:#000000;&quot;/&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Регулярно проводите оценку на тестовом наборе данных, чтобы избежать переобучения.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; color:#000000;&quot;&gt;Segmentation Models упрощает построение и обучение моделей сегментации изображений в PyTorch, предлагая готовый инструментарий для большинства популярных архитектур и задач. Эта библиотека позволит вам быстрее начать эксперименты и добиться лучших результатов в вашей задаче сегментации.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </widget>
              </item>
